{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_06",
  "title": "補票！",
  "storyCode": "RS-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "08cbd0edee386a92e953f74a88615e8a3171cdde1eb71f619f11e3613fcd6a28",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我才不是壞小孩！\n你們、你們不要亂說……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "打就打，誰怕誰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我不是壞小孩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我有媽媽就夠了，才不需要爸爸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "才不需要……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒想到從上面摔下來，竟然誤打誤撞，讓我找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雙生樹……原來是藏在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的是兩棵樹長在一起，應該沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好……這樣就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老媽的事算是辦完了，現在……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是不行，爬不上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡的積雪太厚，山壁太陡，徒手爬不上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只剩下這邊的斷崖……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，羅莎琳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳、咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別太靠近那邊，小心危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行，行，我不過去，你別亂動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的腳還動不了吧？別逞強，先坐著歇會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒那麼嚴重，我總不能讓你摔著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這群維多利亞來的混帳竟然把主意打到你身上，這事不能就這麼完了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以那傢伙真是維多利亞的間諜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實……他也沒把我怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等到真出事可就太遲了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不是時機不對，我一定要揍到他再也不敢踏進我佩爾羅契家的領地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要不是大叔你突然出現，我本來就打算把那傢伙綁起來教訓一頓的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，不提這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你剛剛，那個……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，我最煩拖拖拉拉囉囉嗦嗦的，我就直接問了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個，剛剛摔下來的時候，你為什麼要給我墊背？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有那個維多利亞來的，他說的什麼身分，你知道是什麼意思嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅莎琳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道現在說這些，你可能不好接受，但是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和塔季揚娜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我和你母親，就是在這座山的山頂認識的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和老媽……你的意思是，你是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是你想的那樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅莎琳，你是我的女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這真是稀客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "菈塔托絲，什麼事能讓你這樣急著上門來見我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你應該很清楚我為什麼來，恩希歐迪斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你確定按照我們現在的做法，一點沒根沒據的誘導，就能騙得過那個維多利亞的“灰禮帽”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "越聰明的人，越容易對自己的判斷深信不疑，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不否認這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是恩希歐迪斯，我也要告誡你，別太小看其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然那維多利亞密探看起來確實被誤導了，開始追著那個阿克托斯的女兒跑，但我可不覺得事情會這麼順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬一他沒有按照你想的那樣行動，你準備怎麼處理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你應該不會沒有後手吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿克托斯的女兒在這時回到謝拉格，這件事本身就在我們的計畫之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我當然不可能認為這樣臨時起意的計畫能夠解決所有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽起來，你是有另外的計畫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我看看……今天怎麼沒見到諾希斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有平常都在你身邊的那個女護衛，我聽我那妹妹和妹夫說，最近幾天那位沒怎麼在山上幫你訓練山雪鬼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的消息很靈通，菈塔托絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "諾希斯和鐧自然都有他們的工作，如果你是來見他們兩的，那麼今天可能要讓你失望了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒什麼事要找他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然說……是呢，如果諾希斯在的話，我這裡倒是有個“好消息”要告訴他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是什麼大事，明天你就會知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然和諾希斯也說過，但我還是要親口提醒你，恩希歐迪斯，耶拉岡德像之下的事，你最好是真的有把握……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在這已經不是你希瓦艾什一家的事，我布朗陶家也將碼都押在上頭了，你可千萬記住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "銘記在心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不論是三家，還是聖女大人領導的蔓珠院……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "菈塔托絲，你應當更有信心一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不論你我，還是諾希斯，甚至鐧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們所有人都是為了謝拉格的將來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我如此深信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跑夠了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以及，我要收回剛才說的話，鐧女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你聰明的腦袋裡又想到了什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑騎士確實不會騙人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我擅自誤解了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我原本以為羅莎琳小姐，會是謝拉格布局中關鍵的一環。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若非如此，也不至於我稍微表現出要與其接觸的意向，就出現了這麼多線索……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鐧女士，您不是來阻止我接近阿克托斯和羅莎琳的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是來加深這種誤會的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聰明人總是話多，我搞不懂，也懶得理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，拿起你的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我試試維多利亞的爪牙有多鋒利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我投降，鐧女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們之間有什麼鬥爭的必要呢？這整條線索都是錯誤的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說得對，我該下山吃午餐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“灰禮帽”坦然地舉起雙手，走過鐧的身邊。\n但是，當他走到鐧的背後時，他忽然停住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這只是我的一些小小猜測，鐧女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "據我所知，恩希歐迪斯不是一個無的放矢的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果羅莎琳小姐真的毫不重要，我不相信他會以此為餌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅莎琳小姐確實沒有嫌疑。那麼，問題會不會出在她身後的佩爾羅契家上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會不會，佩爾羅契家運的酒，或者說，佩爾羅契家安排的運輸線路有問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅莎琳小姐的出現是個純粹的意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而正因為如此，你們擔心我見到羅莎琳小姐之後，可能會陰差陽錯地查到佩爾羅契家，發現一些我不該發現的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "才演了這樣一齣戲給我看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鐧沒有說話，只是緩緩舉起了手中的鐧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩爾羅契家負責了謝拉格各種資源的運輸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而謝拉格所有運輸鐵路有一個共同的匯聚點，那就是銀心湖。進一步說，重要的……是耶拉岡德像腳下的湖心島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那座耶拉岡德像上，恐怕有些秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情報人員會把自己的答案說出來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人各有長。論武力，放眼整個維多利亞您也是翹楚。可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您並不能完美控制那些自己都意識不到的細微表情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我認為我猜對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鐧毫不留情地揮下武器，然而，“灰禮帽”早有準備。\n他避過氣浪，避過飛雪，避過殺意，向著山下大步而去。\n鐧緊隨其後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通往銀心湖的馱獸觀覽車即將發車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "經過專業訓練的馱獸，能帶你走過每個景點，看到最好的風景！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想要觀賞沿途風景的旅客不要錯過！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要去銀心湖，給我一頭最快的馱獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最快的可要加錢，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多少錢都行。我正在被一個非常邪惡的人追殺，就當幫我個忙，朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是有人問你我的去向，你就告訴她，你不知道，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我在我女兒寄給我的那些碟片裡看過這樣的情景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（口哨）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就它了，我手下最快的孩子，塔克米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，我不會告訴別人的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“灰禮帽”敏捷地跳進馱獸背上的座位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而後，馱獸邁開腳步，向著銀心湖開始奔跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖嘖，外國人還真有意思，等女兒回來可得給她好好說說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有沒有看到一個穿著黑色大衣的外國人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真來了！抱歉，我沒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，鐧小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你認識我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你忘了嗎，去年我家塔克米拉貨的時候陷進泥淖裡，是你路過把它拉出來的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，確實有這麼一回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，你沒看到是嗎，那我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個混蛋，居然騙我說鐧小姐是壞人，我還把塔克米交給他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我非得給他點教訓不可！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "牧民說著，拿起了一個對講機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔克米！停下，那是個壞人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼，馱獸的機動能力確實不容小覷，關鍵是，它的耐力也非常強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說不定確實可以作為一種戰略資——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "胯下的馱獸忽然開始不安分地躁動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出租馱獸的牧民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鐧小姐，塔克米在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖——被發現了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "糟——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放棄吧，今天無論你想做什麼，我都會看著你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕我只是想去觀光？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我對謝拉格還算了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這可擔當不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活潑的謝拉格人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我今天一定要學會滑冰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的謝拉格人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這句話你已經說了一個月了，再學不會夏天都要到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的謝拉格人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到時候又要等很久湖面才能結冰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活潑的謝拉格人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我今天一定要學會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的謝拉格人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好好好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，借工具一用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活潑的謝拉格人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，我的滑冰鞋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "用這些錢去買雙新的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在四處調查的時候，“灰禮帽”曾經看過冬日的暖陽下，謝拉格人在冰面上滑行的情景。\n他覺得這種活動確實有些樂趣，如果有時間的話，他也想嘗試一下。\n沒想到機會這就來了。\n但他馬上發現自己錯估了一件事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，咦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的謝拉格人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哥們，我還以為你會滑冰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的謝拉格人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這一看就是新手，重心不穩啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
